		<p>Hello&nbsp;(Robert),</p><p><br></p><p><strong>You are currently missing one or more requirements which need to be completed in advance of your service as a park host volunteer with Oregon State Parks. </strong>Please login to your online profile and complete any missing or expired requirements on your profile.</p><p><br></p><p>Volunteer Site:&nbsp;http://volunteer.oprd.oregon.gov/</p><p>Help Guides for Completing Requirements: <a href="https://bql7p776.r.us-east-1.awstrack.me/L0/https:%2F%2Fsites.google.com%2Fview%2Foprdvolunteervoice%2Fget-connected/1/0100019ce87a6e4f-812a9c31-1034-423f-9d24-41e18b147504-000000/hjYqhiGRN08kAf4IXSnCaIXtjBU=469" target="_blank">Click here.</a></p><p><br></p><p><em>All requirements, except for the 'Criminal Background Records Check' and the&nbsp;'Driving Records Check' can be completed and submitted by volunteers. OPRD staff will send the records checks  to volunteers with scheduled upcoming assignment separately through our background check provider Advanced Reporting.</em></p><p><em><br></em></p><p>Thank you,</p><p><p>
